m , 1 singular, suffix 3 masculine singular, אֲרִיצֶנּוּ Jer 49:19 , so read probably also in || Jer 50:44 ( Qr אֲרִיצֵם , > Kt ארוצם ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7828')\">BDB7828</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7323')\">H7323</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H7442')\">H7442</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7827')\">BDB7827</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7829')\">BDB7829</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>רוּץ</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>run</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight> (rare); Ethiopic <placeholder5012/>, Zinjirli <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 1 singular <bdbheb>רצת</bdbheb>; = Aramaic <bdbarc>רְהַט</bdbarc>; <placeholder5013/> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('W')\">W<sup>SG 47</sup></lookup>); compare Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>râƒu</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>be helpful</highlight> (i.e. <highlight>run</highlight> to help?)); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>רָץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 18:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,7)\">Gen 18:7</ref> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>רַצְתָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 12:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,12,5)\">Jer 12:5</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יָרוּץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hab 2:2\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(35,2,2)\">Hab 2:2</ref> +, <bdbheb>יָרֻץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 16:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,16,14)\">Job 16:14</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיָּ֫רָץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 18:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,2)\">Gen 18:2</ref> +, <bdbheb>וַיָּר֑ץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 18:21\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,21)\">2Sam 18:21</ref>.; 1 si